# Every Markdown file, anywhere. Nikola's decision, 2026-08-22.
#
# This covers the governance the project runs on — CLAUDE.md, START_HERE.md,
# PROJECT_PLAN.md, PHASE_STATUS.md, docs/adr, docs/phases, docs/prompts,
# docs/execplans — and the .md half of every evidence package. The files stay on
# disk and the workflow is unaffected locally; they simply stop being published.
#
# Two consequences to know about rather than discover:
#   * codex-result.json still lists REVIEW.md, human-uat.md and the rest as
#     evidence, with their hashes. validate_phase_result.py checks those files
#     exist, so it passes here and would fail on a fresh clone.
#   * a fresh clone has no packets, no ADRs and no agent rules, so no phase can
#     be executed from one. The working copy is the only complete copy — it is
#     not backed up by this repository any more.
*.md

# The phase-executor skill. Nikola's decision, 2026-08-22.
.claude/skills/phase-executor/
